\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>F. Scott Fitzgeralt</strong> — A unique choice that reflects your pet's one-of-a-kind personality and charm.\"}}]\n78:[\"$\",\"p\",\"89\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Paw Patrol</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n79:[\"$\",\"p\",\"90\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Taylor Swift</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n7a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"91\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Droolius Caesar</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n7b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"92\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Agatha Christie</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n7c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"93\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Jimmy Chew</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n7d:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"94\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"81–90\"]}]\n7e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"95\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Neil Armcat</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n7f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"96\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Hercule Poirot</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n80:[\"$\",\"p\",\"97\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chew-barka</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n81:[\"$\",\"p\",\"98\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Gandalf the Greyhound</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n82:[\"$\",\"p\",\"99\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Cat Benatar</strong> — Inspired by pop culture, this name works great for pets that have a dramatic flair or star quality.\"}}]\n83:[\"$\",\"p\",\"100\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Tsunami</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n84:[\"$\",\"p\",\"101\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Joan Jett</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n85:[\"$\",\"p\",\"102\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Luke Skybarker</strong> — This name captures the essence of a loyal and loving friend who brightens every day.\"}}]\n86:[\"$\",\"p\",\"103\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Barky McBarkface</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n87:[\"$\",\"p\",\"104\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Chairman Meow</strong> — With a name like this, your pet is sure to be the talk of the dog park — in the best way possible.\"}}]\n88:[\"$\",\"h3\",\"105\",{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-3 text-gray-800\",\"children\":[\"91–93\"]}]\n89:[\"$\",\"p\",\"106\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Paw McCartney</strong> — Fun to say and easy for your pet to recognize, this name checks all the boxes.\"}}]\n8a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"107\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Bark Twain</strong> — This playful name is perfect for a pet with a big personality and a love for attention.\"}}]\n8b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"108\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Buzz Aldrin</strong> — This name has a timeless quality that works for pets of any age, breed, or temperament.\"}}]\n8c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"109\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"These 120 names represent a diverse collection spanning multiple styles, origins, and inspirations. Each one has been carefully selected for quality and memorability.\"]}]\n8d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"110\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🎯 Expert Tips & Best Practices\"]}]\n8e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"111\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>1. Keep It Short:</strong> One to two syllables is ideal. Names like Max, Luna, or Charlie are easy for pets to recognize and for you to say quickly.\"}}]\n8f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"112\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>2. Avoid Command Confusion:</strong> Don't choose names that sound like common commands. \\\"Kit\\\" sounds like \\\"sit,\\\" \\\"Bo\\\" sounds like \\\"no,\\\" and \\\"Fletch\\\" sounds like \\\"fetch.\\\" This can confuse your pet during training.\"}}]\n90:[\"$\",\"p\",\"113\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>3. Consider Longevity:</strong> A name that's cute for a kitten or puppy should still suit a full-grown cat or dog. \\\"Tiny\\\" might be adorable for a puppy but ironic for a 100-pound adult dog.\"}}]\n91:[\"$\",\"p\",\"114\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>4. Test the \\\"Backdoor Test\\\":</strong> Stand at your back door and call the name loudly three times. If you feel embarrassed, keep looking. You'll be doing this regularly!\"}}]\n92:[\"$\",\"p\",\"115\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>5. Use Positive Association:</strong> Always pair the name with positive experiences — treats, pets, play. Never use your pet's name when scolding them.\"}}]\n93:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"116\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"⚠️ Common Mistakes to Avoid\"]}]\n94:[\"$\",\"p\",\"117\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rushing the Decision:</strong> Take your time. Most new pet owners feel pressure to name their pet immediately, but waiting a few days to understand their personality leads to better choices.\"}}]\n95:[\"$\",\"p\",\"118\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Choosing Names Too Similar to Family Members:</strong> A pet named \\\"Molly\\\" when your daughter's friend is also Molly can create awkward situations. Check that the name doesn't overlap with people in your immediate circle.\"}}]\n96:[\"$\",\"p\",\"119\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Names That Are Hard to Spell or Pronounce:</strong> You'll need to spell your pet's name for vet records, microchip registration, and insurance. X Æ A-12 might be a famous baby name, but it's impractical for daily pet life.\"}}]\n97:[\"$\",\"p\",\"120\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Ignoring Breed Heritage:</strong> A Scottish Terrier named \\\"Haggis\\\" or a Shiba Inu named \\\"Mochi\\\" connects your pet to its breed heritage. Consider names that honor your pet's origins.\"}}]\n98:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"121\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"🔗 Explore More Name Ideas\"]}]\n99:[\"$\",\"p\",\"122\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Looking for more inspiration? Browse our complete collection of name generators: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"81\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lhasa-apso/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Lhasa Apso\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"101\",{\"href\":\"/animal/watchman-goby/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Watchman Goby\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"124\",{\"href\":\"/animal/tiger-shark/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Tiger Shark\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"145\",{\"href\":\"/animal/lop-rabbit/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Lop Rabbit\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names, and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"169\",{\"href\":\"/animal/hammerhead-shark/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Hammerhead Shark\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" names. Each generator features 160+ hand-picked names across 9 unique categories including male, female, cute, funny, fantasy, unique, cool, and baby names.\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What nature names work best for dogs?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Nature names perfect for dogs include: River, Aspen, Willow, Sage, Bear, Rocky, Storm, Sky, Meadow, and Cedar. These names evoke the outdoors and suit active, adventurous dogs who love hiking and exploring.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Are botanical names good for cats?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Botanical names are elegant for cats: Lily, Ivy, Rose, Clover, Fern, Basil, Sage, and Thyme are all lovely choices. Flower names like Daisy, Poppy, and Iris are especially popular for female cats.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What celestial nature names are trending?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Celestial names are having a moment: Luna, Nova, Stella, Orion, Sol, Aurora, Cosmo, and Lyra are all trending upward. They're poetic, gender-neutral, and work for any pet species.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Can I use weather-themed names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Weather names are unique and memorable: Storm, Rain, Snow, Sunny, Cloud, Thunder, Breeze, and Misty all make wonderful pet names. They're especially fitting for pets with corresponding coat colors or personalities.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"wolf\",{\"href\":\"/animal/wolf/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐺\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Wolf\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"fox\",{\"href\":\"/animal/fox/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦊\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Fox\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"deer\",{\"href\":\"/animal/deer/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦌\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Deer\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"rabbit\",{\"href\":\"/animal/rabbit/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"